{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/morning_preliminaries/mah_tovu"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:mah_tovu","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n40.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n          "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:mah_tovu/mah_tovu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:numbers/24/5"}}
{"text":"How becoming are your tents, O Jacob, your dwellings, O Israel."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:mah_tovu/varani"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/5/8"}}
{"text":"And I through the abundance of Thy grace enter Thy house and bow down before Thy holy place in awe of Thee."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/26/8"}}
{"text":"O Lord, I love the site of Thy house, the place of the dwelling of Thy glory."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/95/6","type":"adaptation"}}
{"text":"I bow, throw myself down and kneel before the Lord, my Maker."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:seg","attrs":{"source":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/69/14"}}
{"text":"And as for me, my prayer is to Thee, O Lord, at a time of favour. O God, in the abundance of Thy grace respond to me with the truth of Thy salvation."}
{"end":"t:seg"}
{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
